        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PCF100SBR, Pacific Acrylic Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Pacific Acrylic Door Pull is available in both clear or frosted acrylic with a wide array of bracket finishes. Choose from 9 inch, 12 inch, 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. The Pacific Acrylic Door Handle has a 1 inch diameter regardless of the length. This pull can be surface mounted or thru-bolt mounted. For back-to-back mounting please <a href=\"/products/pacific-acrylic-door-pull-back-to-back-pair-first-impressions-pr-pcf100sbr\">click here</a>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions PCF100SBR Acrylic Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear or Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-PCF01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262232\"><b>First Impressions PCF100SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-PCF1000009SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-PCF100012SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-PCF100018SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-PCF100024SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-PCF100036SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—  it can be custom designed to fit your specific door application in lengths up to 6 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle).</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Pacific Acrylic Door Pull",
                "description": "The Pacific Acrylic Door Pull is available in both clear or frosted acrylic with a wide array of bracket finishes. Choose from 9 inch, 12 inch, 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. The Pacific Acrylic Door Handle has a 1 inch diameter regardless of the length. This pull can be surface mounted or thru-bolt mounted.",
